    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d472">

                <pb facs="0536" n="520" sameAs="frus:frus1947v08/pg520"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">825.248/3–1347: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bowers</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-03-13T19:00:00-04:00">March 13, 1947—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>188. Retiring Chief US Air Mission now submitting report to CDC with copy for
                    Embassy on types airplanes he recommends for Chilean Air Force. I am forwarding
                    copy this report to Department. One point which IX feel calls for early action
                    is following: Chief, Air Mission believes B–25 bombers of which 12 now in Chile
                    under interim program and have not yet been transferred to Chile are not
                    suitable for Chilean Air Force program. Furthermore he has gained impression
                    from conversation with Chilean Air Force officers that Chile would prefer not to
                    purchase these planes owing very great expense operation and other important
                    limitations. Should Chilean Air Force actually express wish not to purchase
                    these B–25’s would appropriate American officials be agreeable? What disposition
                    would be made these aircraft?</p>
                <p>In view imbalance Chilean budget I of course feel any steps which forces might
                    wish to make toward economy operation Expelles are highly desirable. Please
                    telegraph urgently.</p>
                <p>Repeated Panama for CDC.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bowers</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
